---
import SectionBadge from "./SectionBadge.astro";
import SplitHeading from "./SplitHeading.astro";
---

<section id="escrow" class="section-pad overflow-visible bg-background" data-reveal-root>
  <div class="page-wrap grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16 xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,600px)] xl:gap-24 2xl:gap-32">
    <div class="flex max-w-[600px] flex-col items-start gap-6 lg:gap-8">
      <SectionBadge label="Financial Integrity Protocol" />
      <SplitHeading
        class="heading-section"
        text="Escrow. Clear terms. No guesswork."
      />
      <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2" class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <p class="body-copy">
        "Send me the money and I'll send you the logins" leaves too much to chance. Every deal we do goes through escrow, with funds deposited into a third-party account before the purchase agreement is signed.
      </p>
      <p class="text-base leading-[1.6] text-text-secondary">
        The contract spells out what changes hands, when it happens, and what conditions must be met before funds are released. No vague promises. No text-message deals. No guesswork.
      </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3" class="w-full max-w-[600px] justify-self-center lg:justify-self-end">
      <div class="flex w-full flex-col rounded-[32px] bg-velocity-wash px-5 pb-8 pt-5 lg:px-11 lg:pb-12 lg:pt-5">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
          <div class="flex size-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#d0d0d0]">
            <span class="font-serif text-2xl leading-none text-text-on-light">EA</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base text-text-primary">Escrow Agent</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-3 lg:mt-7 lg:gap-3.5">
          <p class="pl-1 text-[15px] text-text-primary lg:text-[19px]">Escrow Agent</p>
          <div class="bubble bubble-in">
            <p class="bubble-copy text-text-on-light">
              Funds received and held in escrow. We're ready for the purchase agreement to be signed.
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="self-center text-sm text-text-primary">
            <span class="font-bold">Today</span> 8:04 AM
          </p>

          <div class="bubble bubble-out">
            <p class="bubble-copy text-text-primary">
              So the money stays with you until the closing conditions are met?
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="pl-1 text-[15px] text-text-primary lg:text-[19px]">Escrow Agent</p>
          <div class="bubble bubble-in">
            <p class="bubble-copy text-text-on-light">
              Correct. We release it only when the conditions in the agreement are satisfied.
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="self-center text-sm text-text-primary">
            <span class="font-bold">Today</span> 8:12 AM
          </p>

          <div class="bubble bubble-out">
            <p class="bubble-copy text-text-primary">
              Got it. Send over the agreement and I'll review the closing conditions.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
